  <para style="h">Yona</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yona</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yona</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yon</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yona</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yona ahunga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryatumwe kuri Yona mwene Amitayi, riti: <verse eid="JON 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2" />“Va hasi uje i Ninewe, ca gisagara kinini, ukiburire, kuko ibibi abakibamwo bakora vyaduze bishika imbere yanje.”<verse eid="JON 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3" />Ariko Yona afata inzira ija i Tarushishi ngo ahunge <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Nuko aramanuka aja i Yopa, ahasanga ubwato bugira buje i Tarushishi, ariha amahera y’urugendo, hanyuma aramanuka yinjira mu bwato kugira ngo aje i Tarushishi, ahunge <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JON 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ateza umuyaga ukomeye mu kiyaga; haba igihuhusi ku buryo ubwato bwagomba kumeneka. <verse eid="JON 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5" />Abari mu bwato bagira ubwoba bwinshi, maze umwe wese atakambira imana yiwe kugira ngo ibatabare. Bafata ivyo bari batwaye mu bwato babiterera mu kiyaga kugira ngo baburemurure.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 1:5">Ariko Yona we yari yamanutse aja hasi mu bwato, araryama asinzira ubutikoma. <verse eid="JON 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6" />Umukuru w’ubwato aza aho Yona aryamye amubwira ati: “Urubahuka gusinzira ibintu bimeze uku? Vyuka utakambire imana yawe hari n’aho yotugirira imbabazi ntidupfe.”<verse eid="JON 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7" />Maze baravugana bati: “Reka tugire ubupfindo kugira ngo tumenye uwutumye ibi vyago bidushikira.” Bagize ubupfindo, bwerekana ko vyavuye kuri Yona. <verse eid="JON 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8" />Baramubaza bati: “Tubarire: ni kuki ibi vyago bidushikiye? Ukora iki? Uva he? Igihugu cawe ni ikihe? Uva mu bwoko ubuhe?”<verse eid="JON 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9" />Arabishura ati: “Ndi Umuheburayo kandi nsenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana yo mw’ijuru yaremye ikiyaga n’isi.”<verse eid="JON 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10" />Ba bagabo bafatwa n’ubwoba bwinshi baramubaza bati: “Ni kuki wakoze ivyo?” Bari bamaze kumenya ko ariko arahunga ngo aje aho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> adashobora kumubona kuko yari yamaze kubibabwira.<verse eid="JON 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11" />Kubera ko igihuhusi cakomeza kwiyongeranya, baca baramubaza bati: “None tugukorere iki kugira ngo duhagarike iki gihuhusi ikiyaga gitekane?”<verse eid="JON 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12" />Arabishura ati: “Nimunterure munte mu kiyaga, maze gica gitekana kuko ndazi ko iki gihuhusi gikomeye kije kubera jewe.”<verse eid="JON 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13" />Aho kumuterera mu kiyaga, ba bagabo bagerageza gusoza ubwato ngo busubire ku musozi ariko birabananira, kuko igihuhusi caca kirushiriza gukomera. <verse eid="JON 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14" />Nuko batakambira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Yona, bati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, turakwinginze ntutwice ku bw’ivyaha vy’uwu muntu. Kandi ntuduharureko amaraso y’umuntu, kuko wewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, wakoze ibiguhimbara.” <verse eid="JON 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15" />Nuko baterura Yona bamuterera mu kiyaga, maze ca gihuhusi kirahagarara, ikiyaga kiratekana. <verse eid="JON 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16" />Ba bagabo bagira ubwoba bwinshi ku bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bamushikanira ikimazi, basezerana n’amasezerano imbere yiwe.<verse eid="JON 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isengesho rya Yona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca azana urufi runini cane, rumira Yona, amara imisi itatu n’amajoro atatu mu nda yarwo.<verse eid="JON 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1" />Nuko Yona asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe ari mu nda y’urwo rufi. <verse eid="JON 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2" />Avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">“Natakambiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndi mu vyago bikomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:2">na we aranyishura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">Ndi mu kibanza c’abapfuye, naratakamvye ngo untabare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:2">nawe wumvise ijwi ryanje.<verse eid="JON 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3" />Wantereye kure cane mu kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:3">kure cane mu mutima w’ikiyaga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:3">imikuba ikomeye yaranzungurutse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:3">imipfunda n’ugusuriranya kw’amazi vyawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:3">vyarandengeye.<verse eid="JON 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4" />Ndavuga nti: ‘Noneho nkuwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:4">imbere y’amaso yawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:4">Ariko nzosubira nihweze</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:4">urusengero rwawe rwera.’<verse eid="JON 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5" />Amazi yarandengeye agomba kunyica,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:5">i bwina mu mazi haranzunguruka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:5">ivyatsi vyo mu kiyaga binyizingira ku mutwe.<verse eid="JON 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6" />Naranyitse nshikira intango y’imisozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:6">aho isi yanyugaraniye ubutakivayo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:6">Ariko wewe, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:6">waduganye ubuzima bwanje ubukuye mu cobo.<verse eid="JON 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7" />Igihe ubuzima bwanje bwariko burakabirana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:7">nibutse wewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:7">ugusenga kwanje kuraduga kuragushikira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:7">mu rusengero rwawe rwera.<verse eid="JON 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8" />Abashira umutima ku bigirwamana bitagira ikimazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:8">batera umugongo urukundo Imana ibakunda.<verse eid="JON 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9" />Ariko jewe, nzogushikanira ikimazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:9">nshize hejuru ijwi ryo kugushimira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:9">Kandi nzoshitsa ivyo nasezeranye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:9">kuko agakiza kanje kava k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="JON 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ategeka urwo rufi, na rwo rudahwa Yona ku nkengera y’ikiyaga.<verse eid="JON 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yona aja i Ninewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1" />Hanyuma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yongera kubwira Yona ubugira kabiri, ati: <verse eid="JON 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2" />“Va hasi uje muri ca gisagara kinini Ninewe ukimenyeshe bwa butumwa nakubwira.”<verse eid="JON 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3" />Yona aca yumvira ijambo ry’Imana aja i Ninewe. Ninewe cari igisagara kinini ku buryo vyafata imisi itatu kugira ngo umuntu ashobore kugicamwo cose. <verse eid="JON 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4" />Nuko Yona amara umusi umwe agendagenda muri ico gisagara asemerera n’ijwi rirenga ati: “Hasigaye imisi mirongo ine gusa Ninewe hagahona.” <verse eid="JON 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5" />Maze abantu b’i Ninewe bizera ubwo butumwa bw’Imana, baca bashinga ko haba ukwisonzesha kandi uhereye ku mukuru ugashika ku muntu mutoya, bambara amagunira.<verse eid="JON 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6" />Ayo majambo ya Yona ashikiriye umwami w’i Ninewe na we aca arahaguruka ava ku ntebe y’ubwami, yambura impuzu z’ubwami, yambara igunira, yongera yicara mu mukungugu. <verse eid="JON 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7" />Aca atanga itegeko i Ninewe rivuga riti:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="JON 3:7">“Itegeko ry’umwami n’abaganwa biwe:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="JON 3:7">Ntihagire abantu canke ibikoko, amasho n’imikuku bigira ico bikoza ku munwa, ntibigire ico birya canke binywa. <verse eid="JON 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8" />Abantu nibambare amagunira mbere n’ibikoko babiyapfuke, hanyuma abantu batakambire Imana binginga, kandi umuntu wese ave mu nzira z’ibibi, bahagarike n’umuryano uri hagati yabo. <verse eid="JON 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9" />Nta wubizi! Hari n’aho Imana yokwisubirako ikigarura, ikareka ugushangashirwa kwayo, maze ntiduhonye.”<verse eid="JON 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10" />Imana ibona ibikorwa vyabo, ingene bahindukiye bakava mu nzira zabo mbi, maze irigarura ntiyabahanisha igihano yari yabateguriye.<verse eid="JON 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yona ashavuzwa n’imbabazi z’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1" />Ariko Yona we, kwigarura kw’Imana kwamuteye ishavu ryinshi. <verse eid="JON 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2" />Ni ko gusenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuga ati: “None ga Mana ibi si vyo nari navuze igihe nari nkiri mu gihugu c’iwacu? Ni na co cari catumye nihutira guhungira i Tarushishi. Kuko nari nsanzwe nzi ko wewe uri Imana igira ubuntu, ifise ikigongwe cinshi, itihutira gushavura, ifise urukundo rwinshi kandi yigarura ntirungike ivyago. <verse eid="JON 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3" />None rero <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nyica, kuko gupfa bindutiye kubaho.”<verse eid="JON 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Mbega aho ubona vyari bikwiye ko ushavura?”<verse eid="JON 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5" />Nuko Yona ava mu gisagara aragenda yicara mu buseruko bwaco, yiyubakira akazu ko kwikingamwo izuba, yicara mu gitutu cako, maze arindira kuraba ibishikira igisagara. <verse eid="JON 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6" />Nuko Imana imeza igiterwa c’amababi maninimanini, kirakura kija hejuru y’umutwe wa Yona kimuha agatutu. Ivyo bica bituma Yona yoroherwa maze aranezerwa cane kubera ico giterwa. <verse eid="JON 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7" />Ariko bukeye Imana irongera ituma urunyo ruraza rurya ca giterwa gica kirakabirana. <verse eid="JON 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8" />Izuba rimaze guseruka, Imana ituma umuyaga ushushe uvuye mu buseruko, iryo zuba na ryo rikubita Yona mu mutwe kugeza aho acika intege. Aca asubira kwisabira gupfa ati: “Gupfa vyondutira kubaho.”<verse eid="JON 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9" />Imana yishura Yona iti: “Mbega aho ubona vyari bikwiye ko ushavura ku bw’iki giterwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 4:9">Na we arishura ati: “Birakwiye nyene! Ahubwo ndashavuye gushika n’aho numva nopfuma mpfa.”<verse eid="JON 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca avuga ati: “Ko ubabajwe n’igiterwa utakoreye canke ngo utume gikura, cakuze mw’ijoro rimwe bukeye kikuma, <verse eid="JON 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11" />mbega jewe sinari nkwiye kugirira ikigongwe Ninewe, igisagara kinini kibamwo abantu barenga ibihumbi ijana na mirongo ibiri badashobora gutandukanya iciza n’ikibi, hamwe n’ibitungano vyaho vyinshi?”<verse eid="JON 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4" />
</usx>